00:036:23.000 --> 00:036:30.000
know his or her habits and you must know his or her temper. You must know his or her

00:036:30.000 --> 00:036:36.000
principles. You just must know the person. You cannot love a person

00:036:36.000 --> 00:036:42.000
without knowing that person. So, this calls for a period of

00:036:42.000 --> 00:036:48.000
acquaintance, getting to know each other. And then based on that knowledge, you

00:036:48.000 --> 00:036:54.000
either love the person or not. And God tells you if you love the person, then

00:036:54.000 --> 00:036:57.000
you get married.

00:036:58.000 --> 00:037:02.000
God says that if this is the person intended for you, God will put love in

00:037:02.000 --> 00:037:07.000
